{"title":"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/c/82c7ce473987f0cba5ea5e6481715fa688b7ea2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(t)=\\frac{t}{1-t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/7/2270a933e5e076478afe24d389bb297e540099ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t \\not= 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"17\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/e/97eded22ccc3e54189a8f157c4e81f36fe034a26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can be expressed as \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/a/fba1ba16238db67eedfc055ccc056125c6f12c44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ f\\left(\\frac{1}{y}\\right)\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -f(y)\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ -f(-y)\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ f(-y)\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"570\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/e/97eded22ccc3e54189a8f157c4e81f36fe034a26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, we can solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. This gives us\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/e/2ee8a47421da5f19fb67fca7918bf696de15332f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\frac{x}{1-x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/2/c6219f39c75ad3d3e33baefb8e180cf60d1d82a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow y(1-x)=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"125\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/1/2e12661126b19da2fa6d5875c50d2265b43b367a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow y-yx=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/2/4d23a11f4ed61af2979ddd39f6bfdaddbe271186.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow y=yx+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e11324e59cb1bb049100d8cd36f95326ea7256b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow y=x(y+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/c/00cf7c0cc6d71450d491327ec379d097cf84f069.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{y}{y+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, we want to find the function with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> that outputs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/f/37f8e0a9195cf83a9c4e501e2147de965ca81ae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y}{y+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"43\" height=\"36\" /> Listing out the possible outputs from each of the given functions we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/32685c7392d3684691dec1bda324afbfb8154242.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\frac{1}{y}\\right)=\\frac{1}{y-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"121\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/f/bdf5c9281a1fde45cdd2a8f051726c84f484f50a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)=\\frac{1}{1-y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"102\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/2/b62ca89142ff747664d2607e5de0b7e8af7a0146.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-y)=\\frac{-y}{y+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"116\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/0/4609af85ae47f318a41d4bd5755f68fa80501b3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-f(y)=\\frac{y}{y-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"120\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/9/0f9f36bd100266c0f63d62e81361d23669b90e41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-f(-y)=\\frac{y}{y+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"130\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e813ee7313e46457b3927fb9cd530da3e61b888.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-f(-y)=\\frac{y}{y+1}=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"166\" height=\"36\" /> the answer must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME\" title=\"1967 AHSME\">1967 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1967 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1967\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b>